    "sentence_translations": [
      "What Is a Name?",
      "",
      "“I am three years old. What about you?” Fanfan asked me.",
      "",
      "“I am one year old.”",
      "",
      "“What about your dad and mom?”",
      "",
      "“I don’t have a dad and mom.”",
      "",
      "“Where is your home?”",
      "",
      "Home? What is a home?",
      "",
      "“I don’t know,” I said.",
      "",
      "“Never mind!” he said. “I don’t have a home either.”",
      "",
      "“What is a name?” I asked him.",
      "",
      "“I don’t know,” he said. “My mom calls me Fanfan, and she says that this is my name.”",
      "",
      "“You have a mom?”",
      "",
      "“I have a mom. My mom … she’s not a cat,” said Fanfan.",
      ""
